        "id": "alice-basic_attack-starshine_waltz",
        "name": "Starshine Waltz (Basic Attack)",
        "description": "When Alice's /bBlade Etiquette//b reaches 1 bar, hold [BASIC] to activate:\n\nHold to charge, expending up to 3 bars of /bBlade Etiquette//b. Release /bBasic Attack//b or when /bBlade Etiquette//b is below 1 bar, Alice performs a series of slashes in an area centered on the target enemy, with the number of hits determined by charge level, dealing massive Physical DMG.\n\nWhen the /bFinishing Move//b of a three-stage charged /bBasic Attack: Starshine Waltz//b hits, it triggers a special Assault effect: Polarized Assault. This deals DMG equal to a percentage of the original Assault, ignoring Anomaly Buildup, and can interact with other Attribute Anomalies, including Physical, to trigger /bDisorder//b. /bBlade Etiquette//b does not accumulate when hitting an enemy. Character is invulnerable while using this skill.",
